sp.p:
If that may be, then all is well. Come, sit down, every mother's son, and re- hearse your parts. Pyramus, you begin;
                                   when you have spoken your speech, enter into that brake: and so every one according
                                   to his cue.  Enter PUCK behind.

Nothing, good mounsieur, but to help Cavalery Cobweb to scratch. I must to the barber's, monsieur; for methinks I am mar- vellous hairy about the face;
                                   and I am such a tender ass, if
                                   my hair do but tickle me, I must scratch.
